   "en": "⟦0⟧ is a minor country in South America with a population of ⟦1⟧. It borders ⟦2⟧ and ⟦3⟧ to the north, ⟦4⟧ to the east and ⟦5⟧ and ⟦6⟧ to the southeast. It starts with a fairly decent army and navy, and few resources.",
