  {
   "k": "1xjuwup",
   "en": "⟦0⟧ like many of its neighbors would declare independence from ⟦1⟧ in 1821, and almost immediately would be involved in numerous conflicts throughout the rest of the 19th century. First it would be involved in a border war with ⟦2⟧ over territories in what is now Ecuador. Once this was concluded Peru and ⟦3⟧ would for several years unite into the ⟦4⟧ and would wage a war with ⟦5⟧. While this union quickly failed, both Peru and Bolivia would fight together in further conflicts with Chile. The losses from these numerous major conflicts would fuel several civil wars which would for decades hinder Peru from being able to fight for territories it still claimed.",
   "frags": 6
  },
  {
   "k": "1s1lfqm",
   "en": "Spain"
  },
  {
   "k": "1orc5sr",
   "en": "Gran Colombia"
  },
